Changes to Navit 0.5.7's navit.xml for the 4NSF unit, applied by apps/navit/fetch.sh.
Italy-centred start, full screen, bigger touch targets (and no duplicate small zoom buttons), a home
button that shows the VW menu and leaves Navit running (the launcher does it: navit.exe menu),
flat map, closer start zoom with auto-zoom (30 s of driving on screen), GPS from COM4: (the unit's
NMEA copy, see docs/apps/navit.md), maps from maps.xml (written by the launcher), layouts with
absolute paths, spoken directions with the built-in eSpeak.
navit.xml is part of Navit (GPL-2.0).

